{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "太短了，我猜这局能撑到二十秒。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.392, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "够不够？我这就去算账。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.385, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 269, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哼，那是我的失误，下次我试试把音调调准。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.253, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 212, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "别怕，先唱起歌来，我帮你把节奏调好。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.819, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 62, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 291, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那把木勺归你，玻璃杯归阿栀。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.212, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 210, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我拿你的木勺，敲两下，听你打拍子。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.989, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 284, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜台上，我负责把云寄来的包裹送到你那里。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.194, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 214, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "先帮它收好，再给你递个伞。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.409, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 280, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，我帮你改路线。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.017, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"error": "模型回复不符合角色JSON结构；未提交草稿"}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "禁止说海，但说老板今天加班，还特意把鱼都锁在柜子里。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.346, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 220, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板今天加班，还特意把鱼锁在柜子里，还请我当临时助手。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.112, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 66, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 302, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁没注意？这扣子比我的鱼鳍还小，连鱼都看不下去了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.337, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 217, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "小名？那扣子得比鱼还小，连鱼都看不下去了。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.057, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 61, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 297, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别累啦，我这就给你讲个笑话，你听好了。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.036, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我坐着，你坐着，我们一起看，别划水。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.331, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 279, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
